Description: Open Trace Format 2 library (intel + impi, OpenHPC)
 OTF2 is a highly scalable, memory efficient event trace data format plus
 support library. It provides an interface for writing and reading trace
 data for performance analysis tools.
 Built with the intel compiler family and impi MPI stack.
 .
 This package is part of the OpenHPC project.
